The stories are all the same
in movies these days.

1097
01:43:13.420 --> 01:43:14.900
The same.

1098
01:43:23.690 --> 01:43:24.830
Shall we go?

1099
01:43:24.990 --> 01:43:26.430
Yes, let's.
